Vendor/ holds third-party and generated code, each folder with its license:

- Vendor/highlights: @pierre/highlights' highlights.wasm compiled to C by
  wasm2c (Apache-2.0, LICENSE.md and NOTICE.md from the package).
- Vendor/wasm2c: the wasm2c runtime from WABT 1.0.42 (Apache-2.0).
- Vendor/simde: SIMD Everywhere 0.8.2, wasm/simd128.h (MIT).

apps/mobile/scripts/generate-highlights.mts writes Vendor/ (except the two
runtime LICENSE files) and cpp/generated/.
